<newsitem itemid="139730" id="root" date="1996-10-24" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Minorco sets private debt placement.</title>
<headline>Minorco sets private debt placement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>International mining-to-paper group Minorco SA said it has raised $400 million through a private placement of debt with U.S.-based institutions.</p>
</text>
